Dear All,
I have an irt online adaptive test with a large item bank and many thousand test takers - so a large, but very sparse result table. I am getting very reliable estimates (sem<2.5).
How could I find out if the test - as a whole - was easier/more difficult for GroupA than for GroupB (e.g. this test is more difficult for people in RightToLeft countries).
I could find functions in mirt to test for individual item differences, but that is not what I am looking for now.
Many thanks for the help.
Balázs

